{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender event distribution pipeline blender event distribution pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","fileName":"Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Event Distribution Pipeline","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Operator and Event System]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Window Event Queue","Blender bContext Structure","Blender Region Event Routing","Blender Operator Handler Dispatch","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender event distribution pipeline blender event distribution pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","fileName":"Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Event Distribution Pipeline","heading":"Blender Event Distribution Pipeline","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Blender distributes events by iterating its windows, establishing the active screen, scene, and view layer, and then consuming each [[Blender Window Event Queue]]. For every event it locates the screen area and region whose rectangles contain the relevant coordinates.\n\nThe dispatcher writes those objects into the [[Blender bContext Structure]], updates region-relative mouse coordinates, and continues through [[Blender Region Event Routing]]. [[Blender Operator Handler Dispatch]] then calls the installed handler capable of invoking the selected operation callback.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Window Event Queue","Blender bContext Structure","Blender Region Event Routing","Blender Operator Handler Dispatch","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender event distribution pipeline blender event distribution pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","fileName":"Blender Event Distribution Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Event Distribution Pipeline","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Window Event Queue","Blender bContext Structure","Blender Region Event Routing","Blender Operator Handler Dispatch","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}